/// Definition: Case manager KPIs per month for CYF case managers: clients, employees, payroll, shifts and schedules, from the monthly case manager KPI table in L4_Analytical (selected columns). One row per case manager, area and calendar month.
/// For analysis: Pre-aggregated in the warehouse. Group by DimCaseManagers, DimArea and DimDate through Month Start Date.
table FactCMMonthlySnapshot
	lineageTag: 8db192c7-a710-4afd-95bc-d7a8f750d525

	/// Definition: Date the calendar month starts.
	/// For analysis: Key: joins DimDate Date; group by DimDate period columns.
	column 'Month Start Date'
		dataType: dateTime
		formatString: Long Date
		lineageTag: 7b5d16d8-2336-4f39-b742-990a22c5b030
		summarizeBy: none
		sourceColumn: Month Start Date

		changedProperty = IsHidden

		annotation SummarizationSetBy = Automatic

	/// Definition: Clients who started with the case manager in the calendar month.
